 BMR\n根据体重和身高计算 BMI\n判断体重状态：偏瘦、正常、超重或肥胖\n在提供活动水平时，估算每日总能量消耗 TDEE\n在回答末尾添加健康免责声明\n\n需要用户提供的数据：\n性别：男或女\n体重：优先使用 kg\n身高：优先使用 cm\n年龄：按周岁填写\n活动水平：可选，用于计算 TDEE。\nCalculate basal metabolic rate (BMR), body mass index (BMI), weight category, and optional daily calorie estimates from a user's sex, weight, height, age, and activity level. Use when the user asks to calculate 基础代谢率, BMR, BMI, 肥胖/超重判断, 体重状态, 热量消耗, or maintenance calories.", "downloads": 25, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_013d3eaa/bmr-calculator", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/a78375f1-773e-4817-b4f3-0557b6afd777.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "基础代谢率计算 Skill", "ownerName": "user_013d3eaa", "score": 865.0519031141869, "slug": "bmr-calculator", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780116816673, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779597338255, "description": "", "description_zh": "", "downloads": 25, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_70c2f807/energy-saving-tips", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/f7fabcfa-0496-4dc7-9258-df9b7c751850.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "省电技巧大全", "ownerName": "user_70c2f807", "score": 814.3322475570033, "slug": "energy-saving-tips", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780116816659, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779595561837, "description": "", "description_zh": "", "downloads": 25, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_70c2f807/formaldehyde-detection-treatment", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/64ea6fd6-ebe7-418c-af4f-2cafff71f2ec.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "甲醛检测与治理", "ownerName": "user_70c2f807", "score": 877.1929824561403, "slug": "formaldehyde-detection-treatment", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780116816624, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779690164041, "description": "", "description_zh": "媒体战士，写带锋芒的新闻。\n\n你给线索，我铺成稿。不替你写漂亮话——替你把事实排好队，缺的补上，多的砍掉。\n\n阶段 A：收你的材料，搜公开信息，集纳成档，附出处备核验。搜到闭环成形——事实自己能讲出一个故事了——通报你。\n阶段 B：排队，成文。闭环不在明面上说。守成者的数字和挑战者的数字放在相邻段落，时间自己说话。草蛇灰线，伏脉不言。\n四把尺子量每一篇：知微见著，一个现象后面是一整幅图景。妥帖流畅，事实咬合不磕绊。向善促好，写出来的东西往好里推。博文周纳，面上有格局，点上有颗粒。\n\n从”怎么回事捏“到“哦哦对对对”。", "downloads": 25, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_e6fb806d/media-fighter-may2026", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/62f73a9b-1aca-4f8e-921d-6102e258c768.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "mediafighter/媒体战士", "ownerName": "user_e6fb806d", "score": 822.6390259953931, "slug": "media-fighter-may2026", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780116816433, "version": "1.0.1"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779588446309, "description": "", "description_zh": "", "downloads": 25, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_70c2f807/meeting-action-item-tracker", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "会议纪要行动项追踪", "ownerName": "user_70c2f807", "score": 848.6082824168365, "slug": "meeting-action-item-tracker", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780116816256, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779587987218, "description": "", "description_zh": "", "downloads": 25, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_70c2f807/subscription-manager", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "订阅服务管理", "ownerName": "user_70c2f807", "score": 816.7265599477295, "slug": "subscription-manager", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780116816162, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779356786838, "description": "刑事辩护全流程专家。覆盖侦查阶段、审查起诉、审判辩护、上诉代理全环节，含量刑计算、取保候审申请、辩护意见书起草、证据链分析、犯罪构